WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.797
An agreement is useful only if people can work

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:07.784
from it The brief handles one decision The working

00:00:07.797 --> 00:00:12.757
agreement makes repeated support more reliable A signed-looking document

00:00:12.797 --> 00:00:16.060
can still hide who may decide which information can

00:00:16.126 --> 00:00:19.336
be shared or who covers an absence We will

00:00:19.402 --> 00:00:23.192
connect the partnership expectations to a practical working agreement

00:00:23.586 --> 00:00:25.810
including the confirmations it depends on
